<speak version="1.0" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2001/10/synthesis" xml:lang="vi-VN"><voice name="vi-VN-NamMinhNeural">Ví dụ, mình viết: </voice><voice name="en-US-AndrewNeural">I saw a cat.</voice><voice name="vi-VN-NamMinhNeural"> Vì đang nói đến một con mèo chưa xác định, mình dùng </voice><voice name="en-US-AndrewNeural"><phoneme alphabet="ipa" ph="ə">A</phoneme></voice><voice name="vi-VN-NamMinhNeural">. Tiếp theo: </voice><voice name="en-US-AndrewNeural">The cat was sleeping.</voice><voice name="vi-VN-NamMinhNeural"> Còn với câu </voice><voice name="en-US-AndrewNeural">I ate an apple.</voice><voice name="vi-VN-NamMinhNeural"> Sau đó: </voice><voice name="en-US-AndrewNeural">Yesterday, I went to school.</voice></speak>
